      "type": "multiple-choice",
      "difficulty": "knowledge-check",
      "stem": "Make $x$ the subject of $\\frac{1}{a} = \\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{b}$.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "$x = a - b$"
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "$x = \\frac{a + b}{ab}$"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "$x = \\frac{1}{a - b}$"
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": "$x = \\frac{ab}{b - a}$"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "d",
      "explanation": "Rearrange: $\\frac{1}{x} = \\frac{1}{a} - \\frac{1}{b} = \\frac{b - a}{ab}$. Take the reciprocal: $x = \\frac{ab}{b - a}$."
